.research/260729_curator-go-to-csk-parity-delta.md:62:No candidate is a release. `refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.4` and `refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.5` are both absent upstream; `refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.3^{}` and `refs/heads/main` both peel to `57c1f568…`. The Curator composite likewise cannot be described as "landed on main": its audit identity is the base commit plus the accepted board handoff chain and the retained worktree. CocoaSkills implementation tasks must record the final accepted Curator composite provenance supplied at handoff, never silently substitute `origin/main`.
