.research/260729_curator-go-to-csk-parity-delta.md:68:Curator gate chain: `TASK-260720-1nlmvv` `development`; `TASK-260720-jrrgw9` `backlog`; `TASK-260720-2qqq0w` `backlog`; `TASK-260720-1pvfj5` `backlog`, blocked by `2qqq0w` and `jrrgw9`; `TASK-260720-3ag6pi` `blocked`. Follow-ups: `TASK-260729-2kaopg` `development`, `TASK-260729-3jku56` `reviewing`. Both CocoaSkills roots list exactly `["TASK-260720-1pvfj5"]` as `blockedBy`.
