+```bash
+git ls-tree -r --name-only HEAD tests/fixtures/skill_go_e2e tests/test_go_build_e2e.py
+git diff --check "$BASE_SHA"..HEAD
+git diff --name-status "$BASE_SHA"..HEAD
+```
