+# CocoaSkills Go E2E readiness audit
+
+**Board item:** `BUG-260802-3ibgu1` (`csk-go-e2e-readiness-audit`)  
+**Delivery target:** `TASK-260720-3pemm6` (`cross-platform-go-build-e2e`)  
